### Why These Steps?  
| Action | Rationale                                                                 |
|--------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `ip_forward=1` | Required for router functionality; without it NAT rules have no effect |
| `MASQUERADE` | Automatically uses Uni-eth₁’s IP as source for outgoing packets → ISP can route responses back |
| Re-test DNS/ICMP | Confirm fixes address both protocol layers |

